Z||000004||mrfixit58||10-24-2001||04:55 PM||||My first automobile was a 65 Chevy panel truck... 283, 3 on the tree, 235/60R on the front, a 13" foam-n-chrome steering wheel and NO POWER STEERING! And, I only weighed 135 pounds soak'n wet... I still can't believe I could actually parallel park the beast. If I owned it today, I'd would definitely add power steering.<P>As far as Fieros, I'd be tempted to add it mostly out of curiosity and to have something a little different. Maybe then I could actually steer around a corner and drink my coffee at the same time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||12
